# Antonym Tug-of-War word bank. One opposite pair per line; each pair is played both ways (A -> B and B -> A),
# so 300 pairs make the 600 numbered rounds. File order is teaching order: rounds 1-100 are level 1, and so on.
# Columns: key|hebrew|translit|english|opposite hebrew|translit|english|pos|picture|scene for the picture
# picture: id:<resolver id> uses an existing indexed picture; =<key> reuses another pair's picture (gendered/plural forms);
#          empty means the pair gets its own picture at assets/games/tugowar/pairs/TUG_<key>.png (see docs/games/TUGOWAR-COMMANDS.md).
# Edit this file, then run: node tools/games/build-tugowar.mjs
